WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:01.708
- Ahhh!

00:00:01.708 --> 00:00:02.541
It's burning!

00:00:02.541 --> 00:00:03.374
Not in this kitchen.

00:00:03.374 --> 00:00:05.120
This is how much I love my mother-in-law.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.750
Today, I'm going to be
cooking a Haitian plate

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.240
for my Haitian mother-in-law

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.780
for the first time.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.480
I have high hopes.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.490
I know I've burnt tortillas
in the past, rice too,

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.790
but I'm sure this is
going to turn out amazing

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.560
and she's going to love it

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.040
but we'll let her be the judge of that.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.529
(Sheryl laughs)

00:00:23.529 --> 00:00:26.359
- You should wear a hair tie,

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.870
because your hair going
to fall all over the food.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.840
- So I'm going to put my hair up.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.130
Let's disregard that.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.270
So we're going to start
with the easiest thing.

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.023
Oh my gosh, I was going to say tostones.

00:00:36.023 --> 00:00:36.856
(beep)

00:00:36.856 --> 00:00:38.510
What are they called again?

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:39.590
Okay. A banana fri

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:40.423
(buzzer sound)

00:00:40.423 --> 00:00:41.579
they, what?

00:00:41.579 --> 00:00:42.412
- [Man] Banana fri.

00:00:42.412 --> 00:00:43.420
(beep)

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.253
- Banan free.

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:45.173
(Sheryl laughs)

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:46.006
(beep)

00:00:46.006 --> 00:00:46.839
The banan fri.

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:47.795
(harp sound)

00:00:47.795 --> 00:00:49.510
(chopping sound)

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.880
It fell inside, it fell inside!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.960
Hold up, hold up, hold up!

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.900
Okay. It's fine.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.403
See? This is why this is here.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.073
Protection.

00:00:58.943 --> 00:01:00.362
(chopping sound)

00:01:00.362 --> 00:01:02.210
(clears throat)

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:03.043
No pressure.

00:01:03.043 --> 00:01:04.143
She's coming right over.

00:01:06.419 --> 00:01:07.252
I'm doing fine, sure.

00:01:07.252 --> 00:01:08.085
Are you doing good?

00:01:08.085 --> 00:01:09.414
Okay, this hurts.

00:01:09.414 --> 00:01:11.774
- [Mother-In-Law] You want me to show you?

00:01:11.774 --> 00:01:13.415
(upbeat music)

00:01:13.415 --> 00:01:14.415
- Ooooohhhh.

00:01:15.454 --> 00:01:16.584
- [Mother-In-Law] You see?

00:01:16.584 --> 00:01:17.844
(laughter)

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:20.393
(upbeat music)

00:01:20.393 --> 00:01:22.819
- [Husband] Okay. Captain America.

00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:23.652
(inspirational music)

00:01:23.652 --> 00:01:24.757
(pot frying loudly)

00:01:24.757 --> 00:01:26.653
- It's ready.

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:28.600
It's definitely ready.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.870
When I do this to myself

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:31.440
I'm going to impress people with these.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.923
The more pressure you put, the
better, the better it gets.

00:01:36.565 --> 00:01:39.440
What?!

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.400
Still really good.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.233
Oh yeah.

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:43.053
Yeah.

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:46.448
(sparkle sounds)

00:01:46.448 --> 00:01:47.600
- [Husband] Ah ah ah ah!

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.433
- Oh!

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:50.950
We're dipping it back inside.

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:52.170
This is painful.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.150
Does your mom do this all the time?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.113
How does she deal with the burns?

00:01:56.113 --> 00:01:56.946
- [Husband] She just goes in.

00:01:56.946 --> 00:01:59.050
- You're not cooking
right if it doesn't hurt.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.820
So now we're going to do chicken and sauce

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.260
which is called Poulet En Sos.

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.400
The traditional Haitian way is to rub it

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:09.220
with lemon and then you
rinse it off with hot water.

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:10.670
We're going to make our epis.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.930
Do you get dizzy from cutting onion?

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.807
- [Husband] No.

00:02:15.807 --> 00:02:16.973
- Oh my God. Hold on.

00:02:16.973 --> 00:02:17.806
(beep)

00:02:17.806 --> 00:02:20.556
(dramatic music)

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.609
- This is how much I
love my mother-in-law.

00:02:25.609 --> 00:02:27.017
I'll cut an onion for her.

00:02:27.017 --> 00:02:27.850
(beep)

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:31.417
(dramatic music)

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.631
I can't see anything.

00:02:33.631 --> 00:02:35.028
(piano music)

00:02:35.028 --> 00:02:38.445
- [Husband] Hello darkness my old friend.

00:02:42.437 --> 00:02:44.090
(blender whirring)

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.390
- [Sheryl] Delicious.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.796
- [Husband] Worth every tear.

00:02:46.796 --> 00:02:49.379
(sizzling pan)

00:02:51.511 --> 00:02:53.520
- I feel like it's finally
starting to come together.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.191
Why is it looking black?

00:02:55.191 --> 00:02:56.311
- [Husband] 'Cause it's burning.

00:02:56.311 --> 00:02:57.750
- Oh my Gosh.

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.720
I think it's too high.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:02.273
Oh, it's burning, It's burning again.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.483
Come on.

00:03:05.399 --> 00:03:06.232
You're not burning today.

00:03:06.232 --> 00:03:07.554
Not in this kitchen.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:10.137
(upbeat music)

00:03:14.432 --> 00:03:15.821
- [Husband] Don't mix it in.

00:03:15.821 --> 00:03:16.654
- Wait, why don't I stir it?

00:03:16.654 --> 00:03:17.743
- [Husband] You let it sit first.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.440
- It looks so good.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.180
Wow. I actually want to eat it.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.389
I didn't think I was going
to want to eat my own food.

00:03:24.389 --> 00:03:27.056
(downbeat jazz)

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:32.617
- [Sheryl] What do you feel
about your daughter-in-law

00:03:32.617 --> 00:03:34.391
cooking for you for the first time?

00:03:34.391 --> 00:03:35.550
(laughs)

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:36.780
- That was a surprise.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:37.780
I'm grateful.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:42.780
The rice look like a
needs a little bit of TLC.

00:03:43.267 --> 00:03:44.460
(laughs)

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.040
The plantain, I like the plantain.

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.750
You know I can see, you
know, something is good.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.512
Is well-done.

00:03:50.512 --> 00:03:53.179
(chewing sound)

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:55.883
That's good.

00:03:55.883 --> 00:03:57.150
And, let's go for the meat.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.950
Mm-hmm. Very good.

00:04:02.971 --> 00:04:05.423
The rice, the main dish.

00:04:06.382 --> 00:04:07.570
(laughs)

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.303
The mother of the Haitian food.

00:04:12.065 --> 00:04:14.815
(chewing sounds)

00:04:16.949 --> 00:04:19.032
(laughs)

00:04:21.356 --> 00:04:23.700
The rice is not cooked well,

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.487
completely, fully.

00:04:25.487 --> 00:04:26.320
(buzzer sounds)

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.153
Just to be honest.

00:04:27.153 --> 00:04:28.540
That's my honest opinion.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.370
With a little bit of small salt, you know,

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.150
and yes there is no salt in there at all.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:36.400
- [Sheryl] You have to rate
the plantain one through 10.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.270
What would you rate it?

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.808
- Eight.

00:04:38.808 --> 00:04:39.641
- [Sheryl] How about the chicken?

00:04:39.641 --> 00:04:41.710
- Very good, a good nine and ten.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.823
The rice, I will give
you four, for effort.

00:04:45.823 --> 00:04:47.100
(laughs)

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:51.280
When we having party at home,
Sheryl cook the chicken.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:53.740
Going to work on the rice though.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:54.573
Thank you.

00:04:54.573 --> 00:04:55.633
